      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/ashwin-sree-97543a413_machine-learning-fresher-jobs-find-64-vacancies-activity-7514275282321731584-W23b": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-10-27T15:25:00.201834+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "🚨 AI JOBS UPDATE – Oct 9, 2026\n\nLooking for your next opportunity in AI? Here are some current AI/ML openings you can explore today 👇\n\n🔹 1. Junior Software Engineer – Fresher AI/ML\n🏢 Company: iCloudEMS\n📍 Location: Remote\n💼 Experience: 0–1 Year (Freshers)\n🌐 Work Mode: Remote\n🛠️ Skills: Python, AI/ML, Generative AI, LLMs, AI Agents\n🔗 Apply: https://lnkd.in/eFPHqV8a\n\n🔹 2. Artificial Intelligence (AI) Associate\n🏢 Company: Advance Agility\n📍 Location: Remote\n💼 Experience: Freshers\n🌐 Work Mode: Remote\n🛠️ Skills: ChatGPT, Claude, Prompt Engineering, Automation, Generative AI\n🔗 Apply: https://lnkd.in/efEgnpnn\n\n🔹 3. GenAI Developer\n🏢 Company: RecruitBots AI\n📍 Location: Remote\n💼 Experience: 0–2 Years\n🌐 Work Mode: Remote\n🛠️ Skills: Machine Learning, AI, Generative AI Tools\n💰 Salary: ₹3,00,000 - ₹8,00,000/year\n🔗 Apply: https://lnkd.in/eV29mn_6\n\n🔹 4. AI/ML Intern\n🏢 Company: WeIntern Pvt Ltd\n📍 Location: Remote\n💼 Experience: Freshers\n🌐 Work Mode: Remote\n🛠️ Skills: Python, ML Algorithms, Data Preprocessing, NumPy, Pandas\n💰 Stipend: ₹10,000 - ₹20,000/month\n🔗 Apply: https://lnkd.in/e3XztRbZ\n\n🔹 5. Computer Vision Trainee\n🏢 Company: Miracle Eye Pvt Ltd\n📍 Location: Remote\n💼 Experience: Freshers\n🌐 Work Mode: Remote\n🛠️ Skills: OpenCV, Python, Machine Learning, Computer Vision\n💰 Salary: ₹2,00,000/year\n🔗 Apply: https://lnkd.in/e5VHhK78\n\n🔹 6. AI Engineer (Entry-Level)\n🏢 Company: Krutrim Insights\n📍 Location: Delhi\n💼 Experience: Freshers\n🌐 Work Mode: On-site\n🛠️ Skills: Python, Python Libraries, AI/ML Fundamentals\n💰 Salary: ₹3,00,000 - ₹5,40,000/year\n🔗 Apply: https://lnkd.in/ej-pbmTZ\n\n🔹 7. AI/ML Trainee | Generative AI\n🏢 Company: WINIT\n📍 Location: Hyderabad\n💼 Experience: Freshers\n🌐 Work Mode: On-site\n🛠️ Skills: Python, SQL, AWS, Generative AI\n💰 Salary: ₹2,00,000 - ₹3,00,000/year\n🔗 Apply: https://lnkd.in/eTfu9-3p\n\n🔹 8. AI/ML Engineer\n🏢 Company: ISHIR\n📍 Location: Remote\n💼 Experience: Entry-Level\n🌐 Work Mode: Remote\n🛠️ Skills: Python, Machine Learning, Generative AI, Model Development\n🔗 Apply: https://lnkd.in/e3XztRbZ\n\n💡 Career Tip: Apply early, tailor your resume to the job description, and keep your LinkedIn profile updated. Highlight your AI/ML projects and practical experience!\n\n🔔 Follow for daily AI job updates, career opportunities, and AI industry news.\n\n#AIJobs #ArtificialIntelligence #MachineLearning #DataScience #AIJobsIndia #TechJobs #FreshersJobs #Jobs #Career #Hiring",
          "posted_at": "2026-10-09T10:47:15.788Z"
        }
      },
